# The five NON-TYPHON creatures - Piranha, Shark, Dragon, Charybdis, Insect - ride a real
# ship hull (monster1-monster5) on behav_npcship rather than the classic Typhon geometry,
# and a host can switch the whole group off. Each of those prefabs guards on this flag, so
# there is no spawn path around it.
#
# LM's server console publishes the real value from settings.yaml; this `default` is the
# runtime twin, so a mod that loads these prefabs without running that console still works.
# It must always hold a real True/False - a shared value of None falls through to task
# scope and resolves as UNKNOWN.
#
# The guards bail with `yield result 0`, deliberately: `->END` returns PollResults.OK_END
# (99) to an awaiting caller, which looks like a valid agent id, and `yield result None`
# never satisfies Promise.done() and would hang the awaiter forever. 0 is falsy, reports
# done, and matches the to_id() "no object" convention.
default shared MONSTER_NON_TYPHON = True